# Pinned squawk release: the Postgres migration linter that holds new foundation migrations to
# expand/contract (scripts/ci/lint_changed.py, .squawk.toml, root ADR-0616 §2-5). The release publishes
# bare executables and no checksum file; these are the SHA-256 of the v2.74.0 assets (2026-11-26). There is
# no Windows arm64 asset, so Windows is not pinned: a Windows laptop skips the SQL lint and CI (Linux) judges.
